      "content": "I'm quite confused by your opening comparison. I specifically requested a strictly formal and objective response to ensure mathematical austerity for my dissertation, yet you've immediately introduced a comparison involving \"goblins\" and \"goblin tunnels.\" \n\nCould you please set aside those analogies and focus strictly on the technical distinction? Specifically, regarding the spectral analysis you mentioned: how can I use the power spectral density to formally differentiate between a structured, periodic nuisance parameter and a series of non-periodic but non-random stochastic shocks? I need the mathematical properties that define these differences.",
